feat: 19 improvements + rocket performance

Immediate Feel:
- Pulse border animation on connecting host card
- Double-click host card to connect
- Recent connections row (last 5, click to reconnect)
- Loading spinner on Connect button

Terminal Quality:
- Bell sound (Web Audio on \a)
- Clickable URLs (xterm web-links addon)
- Zoom Ctrl+=/- and Ctrl+0 reset
- Bracket paste mode support

Workflow Speed:
- Recents section in Connections page
- Snippets searchable from Command Palette (Ctrl+K)
- Connect from palette results

Performance (Rocket):
- Manual chunk splitting (vue, xterm, ui separated)
- Initial JS payload: 33KB (down from 165KB)
- xterm lazy-loaded only when terminal view opens
- Build target: esnext (no polyfills)
- esbuild minification
- Dependency pre-bundling for xterm addons
- 16ms batched terminal writes (60fps)
- 5000 line scrollback cap
